lines=['# Patch08 independent character QC','','**Result: pass within the reviewed scope, with one retained source-limited exception.**','','The reviewed character components are ready for integration. No blocking character defect or required correction was found. This is a fresh independent reading of 13 complete pages and 14 localized targets, supported by original-PDF rendering, source CP checks, PDF glyph draws and embedded font evidence. It does not certify an independent reread of all 2,054 pages.','','## What was actually read','','| Scope | Volume 1 | Volume 2 | Count |','|---|---|---|---:|','| Complete pages | 8 | 1, 2, 1022–1031 | 13 |','| Localized targets only | 150, 178, 315, 399, 433, 600, 641, 671, 962 | 148, 405, 407, 699, 721 | 14 |','','The review actually displayed 28 authenticated images: 13 complete page images and 15 target images, including both the 24× and 60× honorific views. Every supplied image matched an independent original-PDF rerender pixel for pixel. The immutable original PDFs contain 1,023 and 1,031 pages. Their entire page counts are not this review’s visual scope.','','The original files, source story exports, relevant parent ledgers and all files in both author branches were hashed at the beginning. `reviewed_inputs.json` binds '+str(len(manifest['files']))+' files. A final recheck found no changed input.','','## Findings that determine the result','','### Thirteen localized resolutions are supported','','The original PDFs draw the disputed marks described in the 13 proposed resolutions. Several marks overlap a letter or another vowel, so visual stroke count alone cannot establish the number of source codepoints. Original glyph identities, draw origins and nonempty font outlines corroborate the specific duplicated marks. The Arabic source order, anomalous vowels and Bengali duplicate ra-phala remain unchanged.','','| Page | Exact target/source range | Independent conclusion |','|---|---|---|']
